                                                "sense_id": "ddf7f6e1-47ac-3c72-8332-a7af749c906b",
                                                "text": "C. 1687, John Dryden, Epistle to Henry Higden\nThe Grecian wits, who satire first began, / Were pleasant pasquins on the life of man."
